      "title": "University Faculty Directory",
      "description": "University Faculty Directory – Pacific States University (323) 731-2383 admissions@psuca.edu Schedule of Classes Transcript Request PSU E-mail Populi Portal Our University About PSU History Mission & Objectives PSU Identity Accreditation and Licensing Leadership Board of Trustees President University Personnel Directory University Faculty Directory Statistics PSU Disclosures Admissions Overview Admission Requirements Degree Specifics International Students Transferring Students Students with Special Circumstances Accounting Certificate Program Admission Requirement Application Apply Now Application Deadline Net Price Calculator Finance Financial Policies Tuition and Other Fees Payment Method Academic Programs College of Business Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA) Master of Business Administration (MBA) College of Computer Science Bachelor of Science (BS) Master of Science (MS) Continuing Education Center Accounting Certificate Program Office of Registrar Register for Classes Add / Drop / Swap Official Transcript Request Resources Academic Calendar Academic Policies Download Forms Jobs Opportunities Catalog Units conversion chart Campus Life Student Life You Are In, What’s Next? Student Services Facilities Career Services Student Housing Disability Services International Student Guide International Office Curricular Practical Training (CPT) Optional Practical Training (OPT) OPT STEM Extension Resources Student Rights and Responsibilities On-Campus Jobs Opportunities Scholarship Opportunities Download Forms Cyber Learning Center Commencement 2026 Research The Buffinger & Evans Research Institute (J1) PSU AI & Robotics Excellence Lab PSU Student Publication FAQ ✕ University Faculty Directory Home University Faculty Directory Pacific States University has an excellent full-time and adjunct faculty. Its members average 20 years of teaching in higher education and extensive employment experience in their fields of specialization. Business Faculty Jun Choi, MBA - MBA and MS in Legal Studies; specialization in Business law, investment, finance, accounting. Matt Shin, PhD – Doctor of Philo sophy in Management; specialization in Organizational Behavior, Art Management, and Business Graphics. Sung Gyu Park, PhD - Doctor of Philosophy in Economics, specialization in Economics and Finance. Suraksha Gupta, PhD – Doctor of Philosophy in Business Administration; specialization in Marketing and Strategic Management. Tefera Beyen, PhD - Doctor of Philosophy in Accounting; specialization in Accounting, Finance, Tax. Computer Science Faculty Moonsik Kim, MS – Master of Science in Computer Science; focus on Software Engineering and Systems Design. Shamim Akhtar , PhD – Doctor of Philosophy in Electrical Engineering; specialization in Machine Learning Algorithms Sungho Kim, PhD – Doctor of Philosophy in Computer Science; specialization in Artificial Intelligence and Data Science. General Education Faculty Dan Lesho, EdD – Doctor of Education; focus on Philosophy, History, and Civic Studies. Jungil Hwang, PhD – Doctor of Philosophy in Humanities; specialization in History, Anthropology, and East Asian Studies. Roise Uddin, MBA – Master of Business Administration with emphasis in Cybersecurity; specialization in Computer Hardware, Cybersecurity, and Mathematics. Sophia Fernandez , MS – Master of Science in Informatics; focus on English, Writing, Library Science, and Research Methods. Sung Gyu Park, PhD - Doctor of Philosophy in Economics; specialization in Quantitative Methods and Statistics. About PSU History Mission & Objectives Accreditation and Licensing Leadership Board of Trustees President University Personnel Directory University Faculty Directory PSU Disclosures About Us Pacific States University is a private non-profit educational institution approved to operate by the Bureau for Private Postsecondary Education (BPPE) and accredited by the Accrediting Commission of Career Schools and Colleges (ACCSC). Popular Links Academic Catalog Tuition and Other Fees Download Forms Academic Calendar PSU on Facebook Alumni Our Address Pacific States University 3530 Wilshire Boulevard, Suite 1110 Los Angeles, CA 90010 Tel: (323) 731-2383 501(c)(3) Nonprofit, Pacific States University | Terms of Use | All Rights Reserved Need Help? Chat with us Start a Conversation Hi! Click one of our member below to chat on WhatsApp The team typically replies in a few minutes. Admissions Admissions"
